WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.660
There are those whose mission
is to seal the darkness

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.630
and destroy the Ayakashi.

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:08.190
They are called Kekkaishi.

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:13.970
Sumimura Yoshimori and Yukimura Tokine
must protect the Karasumori Site

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:17.000
from the Ayakashi as their clans
have done for many generations.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:22.320
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:24.190
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:29.390
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:31.290
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:34.730
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:39.130
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:42.670
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:46.010
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:51.670
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:56.180
Sha la la la la...

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:02.590
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:04.560
(Secret romance)

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.770
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:11.530
(A strange distance)

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:18.370
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:19.440
Yeah

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:22.910
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:26.650
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:31.850
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:48.460
Daddy?

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:51.300
Are you going to work?

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:53.830
I want to go too.

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:59.810
It's still too early for you.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:03.610
Why? I can use the techniques.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.310
I know. I know that very well.

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:08.180
You're very gifted Tokine.

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:11.590
If I was lord of the land
I would give you rewards.

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:16.320
But unfortunately I'm not a lord.

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:17.760
Daddy!

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:20.060
Like I said
I don't have any rewards for you.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.400
I don't want them! I want to help!

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:28.770
Then let me tell you a secret.

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:31.700
What?

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:35.220
I love you so much Tokine.

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:38.780
I can't bear to let my beloved
only daughter out onto the battlefield.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:40.620
I wouldn't be able to stand it.

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:44.580
That's why you have
to leave this to me

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:46.320
at least until you enter
junior high.

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:49.720
I don't have the Hoin Mark like you

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:51.100
but I'll still do my best.

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.560
It's all to protect your mother and you.

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:54.700
Okay?

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:57.660
Okay...

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:13.550
Why was I thinking about Dad?

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.850
I shouldn't... I'm in the middle of class.

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:39.750
I can't help it.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.410
We take the same way home.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.580
I'm not trying to follow you.

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:47.480
Say, how's your mother?

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:49.290
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:52.380
Did she eat something strange?

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:54.760
I never imagined her starting
a conversation with me.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:56.850
Well, I don't really know.

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:59.260
She comes back sometimes.
But she disappears again right away.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:02.870
I've been told that she's working
as a Kekkaishi somewhere else.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:04.970
Oh...

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:07.100
She's a great Caster,

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:10.080
but she kept refusing the jobs
from the Shadow Organization.

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:12.410
Y-Yeah.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:17.380
I guess you don't really want
to talk about her.

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:21.050
What was the Shadow Organization again?

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:29.990
You were sent here from
the Shadow Organization?

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:33.190
I haven't heard anything of the sort.

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:35.870
This dispatch was a bit sudden.

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:39.170
I understand if you do not believe me.

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:51.080
I actually wanted to send him first,
but he's not very quick.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:55.420
This is the official letter of emergency.
Please accept it.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:00.160
This is a genuine letter
from the Shadow Organization.

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:02.900
But please refrain from using
your powers in public.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.460
Oh, I'm sorry. I'm so careless.

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:10.230
I'm home!

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:16.000
We have a guest?

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:20.540
Pleased to meet you.

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:22.550
My name is Kasuga Yomi.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:27.250
I will be staying here for a while,
so I hope we will get along.

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:30.360
The pleasure is mine.
I'm Yukimura Tokine.

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.650
Please use this cushion.

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:35.730
Why, thank you.

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:39.930
Did you come here for
something work-related?

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:45.530
Yes. It is a secret mission.
So I cannot explain the details,

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.970
but it is a sort of on-site inspection.

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:50.040
I'm just checking on things.

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:54.810
But regardless, I wanted to come
visit this place just once.

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:55.640
Oh?

00:05:56.020 --> 00:06:00.480
Your father helped me
tremendously in the past.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:03.220
You... know my father?

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:07.830
Yes. He had a lovely smile
and was a very fun person.

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:12.730
Tokio-san always cheered me up
whenever I felt down.

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:16.040
I don't know how many times
his smile brightened my day...

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:21.140
I just can't believe someone like
that would pass away so young...

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:23.870
The world can be such
a cruel place.

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:28.310
Oh. Do you mind if I offer
some incense for him later?

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:35.490
Dad's acquaintance...

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:38.680
Dad...

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:43.150
Tokio!

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.160
Dear! Dear!

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.160
Dear!

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:49.270
Shizue-san! Hurry up and
prepare the medicine!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.530
Y-Yes!

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:56.030
Tokio! Tokio! Are you all right?!
Tokio! Tokio!

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.180
That's a Shikigami of the Sumimura...

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:04.210
Tokine tend to your father!

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:15.960
I'm sorry.

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:19.590
When I arrived Tokio-san was already...

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:23.330
But I was able to put down
the Ayakashi.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:26.870
Why did Tokio-san...

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:28.940
Why did he do something
so reckless alone?

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:31.710
I'm not going to thank you!

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:41.350
Tokine...

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:50.660
Be careful.
Don't ever let your guard down...

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:57.670
D-Daddy!

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:02.140
Daddy! Daddy!

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:10.540
Tokine!

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:14.950
Anything unusual!?

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:19.850
No. Hakubi is looking around back
right now.

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.090
She's been acting weird.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.830
Maybe she really did
eat something strange?

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:28.230
Hey Madarao.
You should go look around too.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:30.360
Huh? Why?

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:32.640
I'll just go when something happens.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:34.770
My nose can pick up the scent.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:40.310
I get it...
Man, that Hakubi is so great.

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:43.610
H-Hey! Don't tell me you think that
infantile dog is better than me!

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:46.380
Just you wait! I can find anything!
From bad omens to tiny fragments!

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.410
I'll find all of it!

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:50.650
He's so simple-minded.

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:04.140
H-Hey, I brought you
something good today.

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:07.270
I got into baking chocolate cakes.

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:09.280
This is still a prototype, but...

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:14.350
This one came out pretty nicely,
so let's eat it together.

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:16.910
It's here.

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:19.210
Damn it.

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:26.220
The scent is still here.
But the Negative Energy is gone.

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:28.500
It might have escaped outside.

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:30.530
It must have entered from around here.

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:42.270
Ow...

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:43.500
Yomi-san?

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:46.880
What are you doing here?

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.910
No! It's not that!

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.180
I'm not here because
I'm supposed to do

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:52.950
the on-site investigation here!

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:54.460
Yes! That's not it!

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:56.350
She just gave herself away.

00:09:57.330 --> 00:09:59.690
That's right...
it was a secret mission.

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.150
You know her?

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:03.230
Yeah. She was sent here
by the Shadow Organization,

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:05.100
and she's staying at my home right now.

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:06.590
Shadow Organization?

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:09.000
I've heard of that from somewhere...

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:10.960
Did you cause that weird sensation?

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:15.770
Oh yes. I'm sorry.
My powers are...

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:18.810
Oh no. It can't be.

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:22.470
A Caster shouldn't ever reveal
what her powers are!

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:26.990
Oh that Shadow Organization is
the thing Grandpa was talking about.

00:10:26.990 --> 00:10:29.120
It's that organization of Specially-Talented
people with strange powers.

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:31.630
By the way! You there!

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:34.620
Are you Masamori-san's?

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:37.660
Yes...

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:42.330
I knew it! Hello!
My name is Kasuga Yomi!

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.100
Uh. I'm Sumimura Yoshimori.

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:47.770
But about me being here...

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:49.840
I hope you two will keep that a secret...

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:50.670
All right?

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:52.940
Uh-huh...

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:54.380
Weirdo.

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:57.820
But I'm here anyway,
so let's have some tea.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:01.490
Doesn't everyone have something
they just can't live without?

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:03.750
For me. It's tea.

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:05.960
I can't stand it if I don't have any tea.

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:08.350
Though I prefer freshly brewed ones...

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.360
She sure is well equipped
for the occasion.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:11.490
She has just enough cups for everyone

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:12.800
and even brought a tarp to sit on.

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:16.740
I'm sorry. I wasn't able to
bring sweets to go with the tea.

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:18.700
Why don't you bring out
that cake you made?

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:19.970
You might as well.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:20.670
Huh?!

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:27.550
There wasn't enough for me...

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:31.410
Oh well. At least I got her to have some.

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:35.650
Did you make this?

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:37.860
You. The Sumimura's 22nd in line?

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:39.250
Well... yes...

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:40.820
Hmm...

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:42.520
Huh?

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:46.560
Having some cake with
a Sumimura must... Oh, I'm sorry.

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:50.460
The Sumimura are
a completely different class than me.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:56.510
But like I said yesterday,
Tokio-san treated me very well.

00:11:57.050 --> 00:12:00.070
I've heard much about you, Tokine-san.

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:02.080
I heard the Yukimura family
has an adorable daughter.

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:04.940
And that they love you more
than anything in the world.

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:20.430
Hey, wake up. Class is over.

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:22.270
Huh? Oh...

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:25.230
This really sucks.

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:26.530
What's wrong?

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:29.570
Dad yelled at me yesterday
about my grades.

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:31.710
Wait, you're the one that
sold me the notes

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:33.480
that were guaranteed
to help me on the tests.

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:37.480
Dads are so annoying
when they're at home.

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:39.380
It gets lonely when
they're not around.

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:42.020
You seem to be a really good son.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:47.990
Oh yeah. Your mom took up some work
really far away, right?

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:49.820
Don't tell me you feel lonely.

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:52.260
Oh, shut up! I just...

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:54.130
- I hate guys that lack telepathy!
- I hate guys that lack telepathy!

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:04.800
Hey Kanda.

00:13:05.110 --> 00:13:09.240
S-Sumimura-kun!
I didn't see anything okay!

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:10.410
Huh?

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:18.250
It's a human ghost.

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:22.060
It can't be.
It has to be a coincidence.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:38.380
Yoshimori would you please play
with our Tokine once in a while?

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:41.780
Make sure you keep it a secret
from her grandmother of course.

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:48.350
Tokine's dad...
He was a really nice guy.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.760
Mom. Can I come in?

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:54.150
Yes?

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:09.040
I will fulfill my duty today
just like you, Dad.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:11.730
I'm off.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:12.940
Be careful.

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:17.520
Our daughter sure has grown.

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:20.110
My dear...

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:28.390
Yoshimori-kun! Yoshimori-kun!

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:32.150
Where's Tokine-chan?

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.570
I think she's not here yet.

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:34.860
It's rare for her to be late.

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:37.730
Then why don't we have
some tea together?

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:41.370
Sure. There's something
I want to talk about too.

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:47.010
Grandma, have you seen my Tenketsu?

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:47.770
Oh?

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:49.680
It's not in the usual place.

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:51.040
I don't know either.

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:53.610
Hm. That's odd.

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:56.090
Was my spare in storage?

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:59.590
Could it be? I hope not.

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:01.860
Isn't it beautiful?

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:04.260
It would seem like a waste to eat it.

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:06.200
But it looks delicious.

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:08.940
Let's eat!

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:09.800
Hey...

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:12.800
About Tokine...

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:17.270
Can you not talk about
her father in front of her?

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:21.570
Oh? But I never spoke ill
of her father.

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:23.720
I only said that he helped me
a great deal...

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:27.020
I'm not saying that
you were talking badly about him...

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:30.580
I was small.
So I don't really remember,

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:33.390
but her father died
a really horrible death.

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:36.230
And I heard that he died
in front of her.

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:38.930
I think that talking about him
reminds her

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:41.230
of not only the good things,
but the bad things too.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:47.440
She's really proud of her father,

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:51.880
so that's what makes her
take this job so seriously.

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:56.920
She puts up a bold front
because of that...

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:00.540
I'm sorry. I'm just rambling.

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:04.990
It's all right.
You really care for Tokine-san, don't you?

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:07.290
All right! I'll have some tea then!

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:10.660
You're... so kind.

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:23.840
Such a naïve boy is
the Legitimate Heir?

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:26.180
The world is truly unfair...

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:27.340
What are you?

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:32.750
Come on out. Yoki.

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:55.700
A demon!

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:02.480
An intruder. A big one.

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:04.270
Madarao... is down.

00:17:04.320 --> 00:17:05.310
What?!

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:07.350
- Let's hurry.
- Sure thing, honey!

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:15.150
- Over there!
- All right!

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:18.520
What?!

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:27.100
Are you all right?

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:32.000
Casters fall for the simplest traps.

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:33.440
Yomi-san...

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:36.710
Could it be because
you're too focused on strange things?

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:40.850
Y-Yomi-chan?
What are you doing?

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:53.770
I am the demon tamer. Yomi.

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:57.830
This Karasumori Site
shall now be mine!

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:06.140
Hakubi, can you hear me?

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:07.370
What's going on out there?!

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:11.510
Let go of me, you bastard!

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:27.460
Yomi... this dog also disappeared
when I tried to eat it.

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:33.000
Hmm. Maybe their actual bodies
are somewhere else.

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:35.210
Oh.

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:37.100
You don't need to eat them.

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:41.280
Just being here in Karasumori
should give you unimaginable power.

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:45.180
That's why we should make
this place ours... Yoki.

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:46.850
Really?

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:47.880
Yes.

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:50.920
Will Yoki become faster?

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:51.720
Yes.

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:53.830
Will I become smarter?

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:59.000
Of course. No one will make fun
of us ever again.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:01.160
Great.

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:03.530
What did you do to Hakubi?!

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:05.140
Who knows?

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:08.940
But I have other plans for you.

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:11.770
As long as you don't interfere,
I won't kill you.

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:14.240
Yomi-san! What are you trying to do?!

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:15.780
You didn't hear?

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:18.040
I'm going to take over Karasumori.

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:21.850
This forest your father gave
his life to protect!

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:26.720
Ketsu!

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:31.830
It's useless.

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:34.460
I planted an Enchanted Rock there
to dispel your powers.

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:43.930
A demon...

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:45.400
A large one.

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:46.700
Amazing.

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:48.640
So you opened up a hole on the side.

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:51.410
I told you that I wouldn't kill you
if you didn't interfere.

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:54.720
All right, then.
I have another hostage I can use.

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:56.110
Yoshimori!

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:58.120
I don't need her anymore.

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:00.520
Ketsu!

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:05.590
What did you do to Yoshimori?!

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:09.000
No need to worry.
He's being taken care of.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:11.970
The Sumimura clan has to be
attacked little by little,

00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:13.910
so I intend to use him for
as long as he is useful.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:15.980
But the Yukimura clan.
On the other hand...

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:20.970
If I smash you, the only one left
is your grandmother.

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:23.310
I said, what did you do to Yoshimori?!

00:20:24.350 --> 00:20:29.920
Why aren't these people more concerned
about their own safety? Yoki!

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:31.850
Uh-huh.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:36.550
Yoshimori!

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:49.370
Where am I?

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:52.140
You are pesky, aren't you?

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:56.940
You should just beg for your life.

00:20:57.720 --> 00:21:01.280
All this effort for a job
your dead father left you?

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:03.350
You're really worthless.

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:06.320
This is bad!

00:21:07.190 --> 00:21:08.920
Let me tell you something.

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:14.000
I... really hated your father.

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:17.600
He was a second-rate Caster.

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:20.610
Given the responsibility of this great land
only because of his lineage.

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:22.870
It was too much for him
from the beginning.

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:25.910
He was crushed under
that responsibility and died.

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:28.110
I really laughed.

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:30.710
He needed to know his place.

00:21:31.990 --> 00:21:32.980
Stop...

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:36.210
My father did everything for us...

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:38.950
Just working hard isn't enough.

00:21:38.990 --> 00:21:42.660
You weak humans are limited
in what you can do.

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:46.860
Besides. That man was
always smiling like a fool.

00:21:46.900 --> 00:21:48.430
That only showed how incompetent
he really was.

00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:51.100
The incompetent should
just stay out of the way.

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:53.130
He died in vain, serving no purpose.

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:54.770
His entire existence was worthless.

00:21:56.740 --> 00:21:57.970
It wasn't worthless...

00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:06.890
Wow. Yomi.
I can feel myself getting stronger.

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:10.410
That's right, Yoki.
All of Karasumori is yours.

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:14.390
I think I'll be able to crush her soon.

00:22:23.240 --> 00:22:25.970
I can't... anymore... Dad!

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:27.730
Yoshimori...

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:46.730
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:46.730 --> 00:22:53.430
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:55.000 --> 00:23:02.810
Joking around I noticed after I laughed

00:23:02.810 --> 00:23:09.150
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:18.990
You don't have to say anything it's okay

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:25.360
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:34.440
Straight ahead I'm pushing forward

00:23:34.440 --> 00:23:41.970
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:43.720 --> 00:23:50.960
Even if we are near or far

00:23:50.960 --> 00:23:59.530
The red string connects one to another
